<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 300 mln 12-pct bonds on May 22.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 300 mln 12-pct bonds on May 22.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland will offer 300 million zlotys of 12-percent fixed bonds, due on June 12, 2001, at a primary tender on May 22, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The value date for the tender is June 5, 1997.</p>
<p>Full details on  NBPV.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
